==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
The [[present participle]] of the verb ''[[gilda]]'', literally formed by ''[[gilda]]'' meaning "to [[hold]]" and "to [[apply]]" + ''[[-andi]]'' meaning "[[-ing]]".

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|indec=1}}

# [[valid]], in [[effect]]
#: {{ux|is|Fara verður eftir '''gildandi''' lögum á hverjum tíma.|One must follow the laws '''in effect''' at each time.}}

====Usage notes====
This form is used across all cases, genders and numbers.